        "icon": "🔑",
        "content": "\n                <p>服务器采用层次清晰的 LuckPerms 权限继承架构：</p>\n                <pre><code># 平民进阶层级\ndefault -> lvl1 -> lvl2 -> lvl3 -> lvl4 -> lvl5 -> vip\n\n# 执法与急救序列\npolice_officer (继承 default + police.officer, police.handcuffs)\npolice_chief   (继承 police_officer + police.chief)\n\nparamedic_duty (继承 default + paramedic.duty)\nparamedic_chief(继承 paramedic_duty + paramedic.chief)\n\n# 管理组层级\nhelper -> moderator -> admin -> owner (授予所有 '*' 权限)</code></pre>\n                "
